<span id="S5.T3.5.5.4.1.1" class="ltx_p ltx_align_left"><span id="S5.T3.5.5.4.1.1.1" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:80%;">Very large, non‑preemptive (</span><math id="S5.T3.m9" class="ltx_Math" alttext="1.5\text{\,}\mathrm{C}\mathrm{P}\mathrm{U}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mn mathsize="0.800em">1.5</mn><mtext mathsize="0.800em"> </mtext><mi mathsize="0.800em">CPU</mi></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">1.5\text{\,}\mathrm{C}\mathrm{P}\mathrm{U}</annotation></semantics></math><span id="S5.T3.5.5.4.1.1.2" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:80%;">, </span><math id="S5.T3.m10" class="ltx_Math" alttext="2\text{\,}\mathrm{G}\mathrm{i}\mathrm{B}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mn mathsize="0.800em">2</mn><mtext mathsize="0.800em"> </mtext><mi mathsize="0.800em">GiB</mi></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">2\text{\,}\mathrm{G}\mathrm{i}\mathrm{B}</annotation></semantics></math><span id="S5.T3.5.5.4.1.1.3" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:80%;">). Designed to oversaturate.</span></span>
</span></td>
